<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan c.bank auction withdraws 200 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan c.bank auction withdraws 200 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) withdrew 200 million dirhams from the money market for one week at its repurchase auction, a bank official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bank received bids totalling 3.100 billion dirhams and allocated 2.500 billion dirhams at 6.5 percent interest rate. That was less than the 2.700 billion dirhams leaving the market this week, the official said.</p>
<p>It satisfied 80.6 percent of the demand for liquidity.</p>
<p>The next auction is due on January 2, 1997, the bank said.</p>
<p>($1= 8.7 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
